    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d513">

                <pb facs="1578" n="1420" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1420"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of Uruguay to President
                    Roosevelt</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-08-10"><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have just given the first hand-shaking to Secretary of State Elihu Root. I
                    salute you with lively sentiments of American brotherhood.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">José Batlle y
                    Ordonez.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
